      assign handle_instructions = 'Signature Five-Nut Trail Mix: In a large bowl, combine equal parts DV Gold cashews, walnuts, pistachios, black raisins, and chopped anjeer with toasted pumpkin seeds and a touch of cinnamon. Store in an airtight jar for sustained clean energy.||No-Cook Energy Balls: Blend chopped anjeer and black raisins with cashews, walnuts, and pistachios in a food processor until a sticky dough forms. Roll into bite-sized balls and dust with desiccated coconut. Chill before serving.||High-Protein Breakfast Bowl: Layer thick Greek yogurt with fresh fruit slices, top with chopped anjeer, black raisins, crushed walnuts, cashews, and whole pistachios. Drizzle with raw honey.||Spiced Crunchy Party Mix: Lightly dry-roast cashews, walnuts, and pistachios in a skillet. Toss with black raisins, diced anjeer, chaat masala, and a dash of Himalayan pink salt.||Homemade Dry Fruit Snack Bars: Pulse the five dry fruits with rolled oats and honey. Press firmly into a lined square tin, chill for 1 hour, and slice into pocket-sized energy bars.'
    when 'anjeer-fig-recipes', 'recipes/anjeer-fig-recipes'
